{"id":164,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"深い学びを探究する附属池田中学校","feature_description":"附属池田中学校は大阪教育大学の研究校として、新しい教育理念を追究し、実践を試みる使命を掲げています。知識・技能だけでなく、新しい時代や価値に向き合う思考力を鍛え、深い学びを通して生徒の資質・能力や可能性を伸ばすことを重視します。生徒と教職員が教育実践に取り組み、その成果を社会へ共有・活用する方針と、組織的な教育研究の推進を示しています。","clubs":[{"id":3577,"name":"陸上競技部（男女）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://f.osaka-kyoiku.ac.jp/ikeda-j/students/club-activities/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":3578,"name":"野球部（男子）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://f.osaka-kyoiku.ac.jp/ikeda-j/students/club-activities/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":3579,"name":"卓球部（男女）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://f.osaka-kyoiku.ac.jp/ikeda-j/students/club-activities/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":3580,"name":"バスケットボール部（男子）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://f.osaka-kyoiku.ac.jp/ikeda-j/students/club-activities/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":3581,"name":"バレーボール部（女子）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://f.osaka-kyoiku.ac.jp/ikeda-j/students/club-activities/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":3582,"name":"テニス部（男子）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://f.osaka-kyoiku.ac.jp/ikeda-j/students/club-activities/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":3583,"name":"テニス部（女子）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://f.osaka-kyoiku.ac.jp/ikeda-j/students/club-activities/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":3584,"name":"ダンス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://f.osaka-kyoiku.ac.jp/ikeda-j/students/club-activities/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":3585,"name":"ボッチャ部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://f.osaka-kyoiku.ac.jp/ikeda-j/students/club-activities/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":3586,"name":"ＩＥＥ部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://f.osaka-kyoiku.ac.jp/ikeda-j/students/club-activities/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":3587,"name":"美術部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://f.osaka-kyoiku.ac.jp/ikeda-j/students/club-activities/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":3588,"name":"自然科学部",